    "Restore the native 24-byte dialog_args_t declaration before the existing dialog hook. Native DWARF has no variable/formal referring to that typedef or its underlying record; leave it unused, without dummy objects, forced debug emission or dialog changes.",
    "The project-record discovery found 48 native records: 41 already matched, these five names/scopes/owners were missing, and two SafeBool specializations were not emitted in the current C++ build. SafeBool templates and enum operators already exist in defs.h; do not force extra uses.",
    "One combined build and focused original-record/source checks follow. No full project rescan, reccmp refresh or historical audit replay."
